{"id":4131,"name":"Hibike! Euphonium: Ensemble Contest-hen","slug":"hibike_euphonium_ensemble_contest_hen","synopsis":"The long-awaited new work will be screened in theaters as a medium-length animation in the summer of 2023! \n\r\n\n\r\nAlong with the summer brass band competition, the ensemble contest, commonly known as \"Ancon,\" is a place where exciting performances are held. The performance of several people in one group has a charm different from that of a competition. \n\r\n\n\r\nIn order to participate in the Kyoto prefectural tournament of Ancon, a representative team is selected in the school's preliminary round. However, with over 50 members, the Kitauji High School brass band is facing a variety of problems! Will Kumiko, the newly appointed head of the club, be able to make it through the preliminary rounds? \n\r\n\n\r\nThe days of struggle begin.","format":"OVA","season":"SUMMER","year":2023,"createdAt":"2023-08-06 13:29:57","updatedAt":"2024-03-23 22:33:26","resources":{"nodes":[{"site":"MAL","externalId":51995},{"site":"KITSU","externalId":46158},{"site":"ANILIST","externalId":150429},{"site":"ANIDB","externalId":17441},{"site":"ANIME_PLANET","externalId":20328},{"site":"X","externalId":null},{"site":"OFFICIAL_SITE","externalId":null},{"site":"ANN","externalId":25753}]},"images":{"nodes":[{"id":11317,"facet":"LARGE_COVER","path":"anime/large-cover/PFEXmURPjkJb2NdVYXGXZp2UV0nrqhnZDYxPBSfz.jpg"},{"id":11318,"facet":"SMALL_COVER","path":"anime/small-cover/utQfUPnLunO2irTnp1B7F1GtuOoffcqd3p6INtbz.avif"}]},"studios":{"nodes":[{"id":37,"name":"Kyoto Animation","slug":"kyoto_animation"}]},"series":{"nodes":[{"id":68,"name":"Hibike! Euphonium","slug":"hibike_euphonium"}]},"animethemes":[{"id":12447,"slug":"OP1","type":"OP","sequence":null,"song":{"id":12409,"title":"Omens of Love","titleNative":null},"animethemeentries":[{"id":14554,"version":1,"episodes":null,"nsfw":false,"spoiler":false,"videos":{"nodes":[{"id":17107,"basename":"HibikeEuphoniumEnsemble-OP1